// RUN: fe2o3-mir-ssa-lit %s
// EXPECT: PASS
// CHECK: promoted []
// CHECK: edge e1:0 role=r1 target=b3 defines=[] args=[]
// CHECK: edge e2:0 role=r1 target=b3 defines=[] args=[]
// CHECK: event 0 retained v0
// CHECK: event 1 retained v0
// CHECK-NOT: merge=[v0]
// A whole definition on only one path does not supply a complete SSA holder
// at the join. Source memory verification still checks each retained access.

entry b0
variables !v0
block b0
edge r1 b1
edge r2 b2
block b1
def v0
edge r1 b3
block b2
edge r1 b3
block b3
use v0
def v0
use v0
